  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The future",
     "texto": [
      "To express a future action as a process or habit, imperfective verbs use **буду, будешь, будет, будем, будете, будут + infinitive**: **Я буду работать** = I will work.",
      "**Что ты будешь делать завтра?** = what are you going to do tomorrow? If **буду** appears without an infinitive, it can mean «I will be»: **Завтра я буду дома** = tomorrow I will be at home.",
      "For a trip that is already decided, a movement verb can also be used in the present: **На следующей неделе я еду в Москву** = next week I'm going to Moscow."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
