    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Suggesting a plan",
     "texto": [
      "**Давай пойдём в кино!** = let's go to the cinema! The verb form is in the first person plural: **давай** is used with one person you address informally; **давайте**, with several people or with formal «you».",
      "To accept: **С удовольствием!** (with pleasure!) or **Хорошая идея!** (good idea!).",
      "To say no: **К сожалению, я не могу** (unfortunately, I can't)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When and where",
     "texto": [
      "**Завтра** (tomorrow), **послезавтра** (the day after tomorrow), **в выходные** (at the weekend), **на следующей неделе** (next week).",
      "**Где встретимся?** = where shall we meet? **До завтра!** = see you tomorrow!"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
